msgctxt "draft page"
msgid "Withdraw this draft? It is kept on record, and it can no longer be published. Nothing on the org chart changes."
msgstr "¿Retirar este borrador? Se guarda en el registro y ya no se puede publicar. Nada cambia en el organigrama."

